// Google SecOps (Chronicle) UDM Hunting Queries
// Advisory: Lumma Stealer & RedLine MaaS Campaign Abusing Fake CAPTCHA & ClickFix PowerShell Lures
// Severity: High | Actor: Storm-1607 MaaS Affiliates | Malware: Lumma Stealer
// CVE References: CVE-2025-21333
